OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and rather breezy day
OL,6,Fwith a few bright spells between
OL,7,Fscattered showers, more showers likely
OL,8,Fin the west. Feeling a bit chillier
OL,9,Fthan of late.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRemaining cloudy with showers
OL,12,Fin the west continuing through the
OL,13,Fevening, a few clearer spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping overnight especially in the
OL,15,Feast.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FA cloudy and damp start
OL,18,Fwith some heavy showers in the west,
OL,19,Fshowers tending to develop across the
OL,20,Farea with the risk of them becoming
OL,21,Fslow moving with some thunder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
